    <briefdescription>
<para>MonoBehaviour that automatically generates two LOD levels for its GameObject using UnityMeshSimplifier&apos;s LODGenerator on Awake. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>LOD 0 keeps full-quality geometry; LOD 1 uses 65 % mesh quality with combined meshes for better performance. The last LOD is culled by default. Added dynamically to downloaded patent models by QRNetworkHandler. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
